92-8a44-579f-86c2-342bf4ded94b" 13194139535522 true] [17592186353544 1145 "For a surface $S$ defined by $z=g(x,y)$ with $(x,y)\\in D,$ the surface integral of a scalar function $f(x,y,z)$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}f(x,y,g(x,y))\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂x})}^{2}+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂y})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nFor the partial derivatives, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂z}{∂x}=\\frac{∂}{∂x}(y-2x)=-2\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂z}{∂y}=\\frac{∂}{∂y}(y-2x)=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}f(x,y,g(x,y))\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂x})}^{2}+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂y})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}f(x,y,g(x,y))\\sqrt{1+{(-2)}^{2}+{(1)}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,\\sqrt{6}\\,xy(y-2x)^{2}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{-1}^{1}\\,\\sqrt{6}\\,xy(y-2x)^{2}\\,\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535522 true] [17592186353545 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353546 13194139535522 true] [17592186353545 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353547 13194139535522 true] [17592186353545 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353548 13194139535522 true] [17592186353545 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353549 13194139535522 true] [17592186353545 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353550 13194139535522 true] [17592186353545 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535522 true] [17592186353545 1041 "selection" 13194139535522 true] [17592186353545 1104 #edb/ref 17592186353546 13194139535522 true] [17592186353545 1110 #uuid "b2446793-bd4d-550e-a18f-714dfdef0557" 13194139535522 true] [17592186353546 1034 "\\sqrt{6}\\,xy(y-2x)^{2}" 13194139535522 true] [17592186353546 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535522 true] [17592186353546 1111 #uuid "bfb5dd34-fc81-54c7-9cc3-58c985496ef4" 13194139535522 true] [17592186353547 1034 "3{x}^{2}y(y-2x)^{2}" 13194139535522 true] [17592186353547 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535522 true] [17592186353547 1111 #uuid "ad2b4beb-909e-54a4-a252-9c06c51fcc18" 13194139535522 true] [1759